WEBVTT

00:00:21.581 --> 00:00:23.161
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> Hi. How can I help you?

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.521
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Hi. How much is this tuna salad?

00:00:25.703 --> 00:00:26.728
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> It’s seven twenty.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:28.492
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> OK, fine.

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.748
And a mineral water, please.

00:00:34.026 --> 00:00:36.199
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> That’s nine dollars seventy cents.

00:00:38.146 --> 00:00:38.642
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.699
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> Thank you. Have a nice day.

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:48.208
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Jenny!

00:00:48.449 --> 00:00:50.713
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Amy! Hi, how are you?

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:52.199
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> I’m fine. How are you?

00:00:52.377 --> 00:00:53.311
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> I’m fine, too.

00:00:54.082 --> 00:00:54.575
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> What’s that?

00:00:55.059 --> 00:00:57.173
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Oh, just a salad and some water.

00:00:57.681 --> 00:01:00.093
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> You are good! Look, wait for me.

00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:01.642
We can have lunch together in the park.

00:01:02.055 --> 00:01:03.520
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Sure! Great idea.

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:10.818
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Can I have a cheese sandwich, a cappuccino, and a brownie, please?